  Title: The Sky Holder
  Description: 'Before <color=red>The Great Ram</color> took the sky from Soza, this
    enormous column used to support a giant protective dome of blue light.

    The
    internals of this column are hollow and known to be the safest place for Sozan''s
    to work. The top of it is used as a resource dropoff point.'
